mH₂O with input flow of 4 to 15 L/min (recommended starting range 6-8 L/min)."},{"q":"Where can I download the Nasal Tube for Bubble CPAP Fisher & Paykel datasheet?","a":"On this page, with the “Download datasheet” button: it is the official Fisher & Paykel Healthcare PDF (in English)."}],"seo_keywords_es":["tubo nasal FlexiTrunk","FlexiTrunk Fisher & Paykel","interfaz CPAP neonatal","CPAP de burbuja prematuros","insumos CPAP neonatal Colombia","instrucciones Bubble CPAP BC161"],"seo_keywords_en":["FlexiTrunk nasal tube","Fisher & Paykel FlexiTrunk","neonatal CPAP interface","preterm bubble CPAP","neonatal CPAP supplies Colombia","Bubble CPAP BC161 instructions"],"ficha_fabricante":{"fabricante":"Fisher & Paykel Healthcare","idioma":"en","url_origen":"https://resources.fphcare.com/content/bubble-cpap-system-ui-185042847.pdf","descargada":"2026-10-02"}}$j$::jsonb
