ng range 6-8 L/min)."},{"q":"Where can I download the Fisher & Paykel Bubble CPAP Nasal Mask datasheet?","a":"On this page, with the “Download datasheet” button: it is the official Fisher & Paykel Healthcare PDF (in English)."}],"seo_keywords_es":["máscara CPAP de burbuja","máscara nasal neonatal","CPAP neonatal Fisher & Paykel","interfaz nasal prematuros","insumos CPAP neonatal Colombia","instrucciones Bubble CPAP"],"seo_keywords_en":["bubble CPAP mask","neonatal nasal mask","Fisher & Paykel neonatal CPAP","preterm nasal interface","neonatal CPAP supplies Colombia","Bubble CPAP instructions"],"ficha_fabricante":{"fabricante":"Fisher & Paykel Healthcare","idioma":"en","url_origen":"https://resources.fphcare.com/content/bubble-cpap-system-ui-185042847.pdf","descargada":"2026-10-02"}}$j$::jsonb
