el Bubble CPAP Cap datasheet?","a":"On this page, with the “Download datasheet” button: it is the official Fisher & Paykel Healthcare PDF (in English)."}],"seo_keywords_es":["gorro CPAP de burbuja","gorro FlexiTrunk","fijación CPAP neonatal","gorro Fisher & Paykel","insumos CPAP neonatal Colombia","instrucciones Bubble CPAP"],"seo_keywords_en":["bubble CPAP bonnet","FlexiTrunk bonnet","neonatal CPAP securement","Fisher & Paykel bonnet","neonatal CPAP supplies Colombia","Bubble CPAP instructions"],"ficha_fabricante":{"fabricante":"Fisher & Paykel Healthcare","idioma":"en","url_origen":"https://resources.fphcare.com/content/bubble-cpap-system-ui-185042847.pdf","descargada":"2026-10-02"}}$j$::jsonb
